OL,3,GNEWSAStrike planned at SEND school over
OL,4,Astaffing row
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome teaching support staff at a school
OL,7,Ffor pupils with severe or profound
OL,8,Flearning difficulties are to strike in
OL,9,Fa row over staff shortages.
OL,11,FUplands School in Swindon, Wiltshire,
OL,12,Fnotified parents on Wednesday that the
OL,13,Fschool would be closed on 24 and 25
OL,14,FNovember.
OL,16,FDavid McMullen, senior organiser with
OL,17,Fthe GMB union, said its members and
OL,18,Fpupils had been left in "unsafe
OL,19,Fsituations" and it had "been left with
OL,20,Fno choice" but to strike.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
